      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards; council members are not explicitly confirmed present in the projection.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts:\n- Players: Actively present in the chamber, influencing the council and engaged in the battle.\n- the Wolf: Explicitly located in the Council Room and is the central adversary of the encounter.\n- Thalia: Present with \u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder,\u201d and participates in combat (initially acting under his influence).\n- Guards: Present and reinforcing\u2014\u201cguards are being drawn here as reinforcements,\u201d with multiple guards (including elite ones) actively engaging.\n\nNotably absent:\n- Council members are referenced indirectly (players recounting their story, influencing proceedings), but there is no explicit confirmation they are physically present during the fight.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Participants: Players (group of 6), the Wolf, Thalia (Commander of the Guard), Guards (8 regular + 2 elite per OBSERVED)\n- \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0924\u093f (Operational): Active combat with reinforcements arriving\n- Environment: Council chamber with magical defenses (illusory walls, runes) affecting the fight",
      "embedding_similarity": null,
      "claim_verification": {
