      "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is dead at the end of Session 12\u2014**Decapitated; head removed from body**\u2014and was still visibly corrupted prior to death.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- physical_condition (OBSERVED): **Decapitated; head removed from body**; had \u201can oily sheen to his eyes.\u201d\n- operational_status (OBSERVED): Was attempting to escape invisibly, but this is superseded by his death.\n- mental_state (OBSERVED): Desperate, begging for release or death (pre-death context).\n- faction (OBSERVED): Cultist\n- history (OBSERVED): Attacked by Bonogo; Bonogo ultimately removed his head.\n\nExplanation:\nAlthough earlier in the session the Wolf was escaping and invisible, the terminal outcome \u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d overrides all prior states. His corruption is evidenced by \u201coily sheen to his eyes,\u201d and there is no indication it was cured before death. Therefore, his final state is dead, formerly corrupted.",
      "embedding_similarity": null,
      "claim_verification": {
